    <item>
      <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jan 2025 13:53:09 -0600</pubDate>
      <title>You're Invited: Annual Martin Luther King Jr. March and Program!</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">63649868</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/3cb384c</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none; background-color: #00539b;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2017/11/1671525/govdelivery-neighborhoods_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Department of Neighborhoods" width="600" height="225">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2025/01/10813262/mlk-march-2024-v1-3_original.png" style="width: 500px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="MLK March 2025" width="500" height="419"></td></tr></table>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><em>Join Us for the City of Columbus Annual Martin Luther King Jr. March and Program</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Dear Community Leaders,</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We are excited to invite you to the <strong>City of Columbus Annual Martin Luther King Jr. March and Program</strong> as we come together to celebrate the life and legacy of Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Theme:</strong> <em>“Honoring the Legacy, Uniting the Future”</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Keynote Speaker:</strong> Lead Pastor <strong>Mike Young</strong> of <strong>City of Grace</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Event Details: </strong>January 20, 2025</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><span class="apple-tab-span" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">   </span>•<span class="apple-tab-span" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">       </span><strong>March Kickoff:</strong> 3:30 PM</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><span class="apple-tab-span" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">   </span>•<span class="apple-tab-span" style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">       </span><strong>Program Start:</strong> 5:00 PM</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Location: Historical Lincoln Theatre</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">This inspiring event will honor Dr. King’s enduring impact and highlight the importance of unity as we look toward the future.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We hope you’ll join us as we reflect, celebrate, and commit to building a brighter tomorrow.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Mark your calendar and spread the word!</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We look forward to seeing you there! <a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/c4c74f51df184ac18b1519316dfe0aa0?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Click here to RSVP!</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table></td></tr></table>]]>
      </description>
    </item>
