      <title>You're Invited! The 2024 Neighborhood Best Practices Conference!</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">61570668</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/3ab7e6c</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none; background-color: #00539b;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2017/11/1671525/govdelivery-neighborhoods_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Department of Neighborhoods" width="600" height="225">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">The 2024 Neighborhood Best Practices Conference: Let US Grow Together!</h1>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/07/9900589/neighborhoods-best-practice-conference-2024-3_original.png" style="width: 560px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="NBPC 2" width="560" height="470"><div class="xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a">
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"> </p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>9:00 a.m. - 12:00 p.m.</strong><br><strong>Saturday, September 14, 2024</strong><br><strong>315 Cleveland Ave</strong><br><strong>Columbus State Community College</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We can't wait for you to join us at the Neighborhood Best Practices Conference this year on Saturday, September 14th from 9:00 a.m. - 12:00 p.m.</p>
</div>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">This year's theme is <strong>Let US Grow Together</strong>! With 3 million people expected to call central Ohio home by 2050, we must work collectively to ensure our growth is equitable and allows everyone to prosper.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Join us for interactive sessions focused on key initiatives that will help address the challenges of our growing community!</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><br>RSVP <a class="html-a xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"></a>through the QR code or by following this link:</p>
<div class="x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a">
<h3 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 16px; margin: 30px 0;" align="center"><span class="html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs" style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://us.openforms.com/Form/a18bcfc9-a63c-4c8d-ad18-d063453d5841?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAAR3O_n2502uwwdk2R97q8B7mvmuATeVzJVweXkaimEBIPVdsC_563j7weWE_aem_6u8KN7M8I9spfosLdB2TFg&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" class="x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n xd10rxx x1sy0etr x17r0tee x972fbf xcfux6l x1qhh985 xm0m39n x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz x1sur9pj xkrqix3 x1fey0fg" rel="noopener" style="color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none; background-color: #00539b; border-radius: 3px; border-color: #00539b; border-style: solid; border-width: 12px 25px;">Click Here to RSVP</a></span></h3>
