<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Join Us for the 2024 MBK and COBG College, Career and Community Fair</h1>
<h2 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">To register just scan the QR codes or follow the links below. </h2>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2024/03/9145270/cccf-post-instagram-post-2_original.png" style="width: 560px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="College Fair" width="560" height="560"><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"> </p>
<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>2024 MBK &amp; COBG College, Career &amp; Community Fair: Empowering Columbus' Youth</strong></h1>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Join My Brother's Keeper and the Commission on Black Girls for an exciting event sponsored by Crane Group, part of The Classic For Columbus All-Star Game lineup! This inclusive fair offers hundreds of local students and families the chance to explore many opportunities.<strong> </strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Connect with your future:</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Meet employers: </strong>Find jobs for adults and youth!</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Explore summer programs: </strong>Discover enrichment opportunities for teens.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Unlock higher education: </strong>Get insights from Historically Black Colleges and Universities.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Empower your community: </strong>Connect with program and city leaders and learn about the impact of these positive resources on Columbus' youth.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Mark your calendars!</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Date:</strong> Saturday, April 13, 2024</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Time:</strong> 10:00 a.m. – 2:00 p.m.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Location:</strong> Africentric Early College, Fieldhouse</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Address:</strong> 3223 Allegheny Avenue</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong> </strong><strong>Let's build brighter futures together!</strong></p>
<h2 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>Please RSVP Below</strong></h2>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>2024 Job Fair Employer &amp; Community Partner Registration Link</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/5502032a0cf846d49588ef0c4d4fc11c?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Crane Group presents the 2024 MBK College, Career &amp; Community Job Fair - Employer Registration (smartsheet.com)</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><strong>College and Career Fair Registration</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center"><a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/df1d99c6c85245dc9bbfa3c5eb4df8ce?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/df1d99c6c85245dc9bbfa3c5eb4df8ce</a></p>
